dle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 35 years. In 2025 that same pair ran 48% of normal on the middle, while April to May hit 156%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 56% and February to March at 58% on the middle. Grid 17545 had its driest year in 1963 at 56%.</p>"}
